1c:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-16 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Frequently asked questions"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","div","What exactly is included in the Repair Sprint?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"What exactly is included in the Repair Sprint?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-fg-muted","children":"The exact replacement - copy, code snippet, or configuration change - written specifically for what was found on your page. Not \"improve your H1.\" The actual replacement H1 text. Not \"add social proof.\" The specific proof element and where to place it. Plus a 30-day re-audit to confirm the condition changed."}]]}],["$","div","How is this different from a generic CRO audit report?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"How is this different from a generic CRO audit report?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-fg-muted","children":"A report tells you what is wrong. The Repair Sprint tells you what to change it to. Nebula reads your actual page HTML - your specific H1, your CTA label, your meta description - and writes the replacement for that page. Generic advice is not included because it is not useful."}]]}],["$","div","Why only one finding?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Why only one finding?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-fg-muted","children":"A bounded change is testable and honest. Changing multiple things at once makes it impossible to know what worked. The Repair Sprint fixes the highest-priority finding first, the 30-day re-audit confirms it held, then you have real evidence to act on next."}]]}],["$","div","Do I need to give Nebula access to my site?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Do I need to give Nebula access to my site?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-fg-muted","children":"No. The kit is sent to your email after payment - you or your developer applies it. Nebula never needs CMS, hosting, or repository access. The audit reads your public page HTML."}]]}],["$","div","How long does the whole process take?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"How long does the whole process take?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-fg-muted","children":"The audit completes in under 30 seconds. The repair kit arrives within 48 hours of payment. Implementation time depends on what the fix requires - copy changes are minutes, code changes depend on your stack."}]]}],["$","div","Does the repair guarantee more conversions?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Does the repair guarantee more conversions?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-fg-muted","children":"No - and any service that guarantees conversion lift without a controlled traffic test is making it up. The 30-day re-audit confirms whether the specific page condition changed. Conversion outcomes also depend on traffic quality and offer strength. You get verifiable evidence of what changed, not a revenue promise."}]]}]]}]]}]
